     &SCF
       MAX_SCF 200
       EPS_SCF  5.0000000000000002E-005
       SCF_GUESS RESTART
       ADDED_MOS 100
       &DIAGONALIZATION T
         ALGORITHM STANDARD
       &END DIAGONALIZATION
